<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="entities">
  <title>Entities</title>
  <body>
    <p>Entities represent the core objects in the system.</p>
    <section>
      <title>Primary Entities</title>
      <ul>
        <li><b>User</b> - Represents system users</li>
        <li><b>Document</b> - Represents content items</li>
        <li><b>Project</b> - Represents work containers</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>Entity Properties</title>
      <p>Each entity has a set of attributes that define its characteristics:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Unique identifier</li>
        <li>Timestamps (created, modified)</li>
        <li>Status</li>
        <li>Metadata</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>
